WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.875
Step 2.

00:00:01.825 --> 00:00:11.412
Brookfield Asset Management — where PM Carney spent 4 years as board chair — describes itself as one of the largest owners of seniors housing globally.

00:00:11.412 --> 00:00:15.150
MAID reduces demand for long-term seniors care.

00:00:15.150 --> 00:00:21.175
Fewer patients in the pipeline means different market dynamics for the firms that own the facilities.
